      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'm seeing some really weird spikes in the salinity readings though, like they're jumping around totally inconsistently for a few minutes at a time. it doesn't seem to match the temperature curve at all. does that sound like a sensor error or is there a physical reason for that kind of noise in the vertical profile?",
